---
import SolutionPage from '../../components/SolutionPage.astro';
---
<SolutionPage
  path="new-fireplace"
  metaTitle="Add a New Fireplace: Gas & Electric Fireplaces in NYC"
  metaDescription="Adding a fireplace to a room, renovation or new build? We help you choose between gas, electric and other options, then plan the installation. Call 718-326-4328."
  eyebrow="Add a new fireplace"
  title="A new fireplace, chosen for your room and your building."
  lede="No fireplace there today? In most homes that is not a problem. We help you work out what is possible in your space, then narrow it to a few options worth seeing."
  heroProject="modern-fireplace"
  heroAlt="Linear fireplace built into a stone media wall in a bright living room"
  crumbs={[['Fireplaces', '/fireplaces/']]}
  projectType="new-fireplace"
  whoFor={[
    'You are renovating or building and want a fireplace in the plan.',
    'The room has no fireplace or chimney today.',
    'You live in an apartment, condo or co-op and are not sure what is allowed.',
    'You are planning a media wall and want the fireplace and TV to work together.',
  ]}
  optionsHeading="Three directions most new fireplaces take"
  optionsIntro="Each suits a different kind of room. Seeing which one sounds like yours is usually the fastest way to begin."
  compare={{
    caption: 'Comparing new fireplace options',
    columns: ['Direct-vent gas', 'Electric', 'Water vapor or ethanol'],
    rows: [
      ['What it needs', 'A gas supply and a vent route to an outside wall or the roof', 'An electrical supply', 'Power and water for vapor; liquid fuel for ethanol'],
      ['Chimney', 'Not required', 'Not required', 'Not required'],
      ['Flame', 'Real flame behind glass', 'Flame effect', 'Mist-and-light effect (vapor) or real flame (ethanol)'],
      ['Heat', 'Yes, a real heat source', 'Optional, modest', 'Mainly for atmosphere'],
      ['Often chosen for', 'Houses, renovations and new construction', 'Apartments, bedrooms and media walls', 'Spaces where gas and venting are not possible'],
      ['To discuss with us', 'Vent route, gas line, wall design', 'Power location, recessed or wall-mounted', 'Building rules and how you plan to use it'],
    ],
  }}
  questions={[
    'Is there a route to vent outside, and is gas available?',
    'Do you want real heat, or mainly the look of a fire?',
    'What will go above and around it: a TV, a mantel, stone, built-ins?',
    'Is a contractor or designer already involved?',
    'Are there building or board rules to work within?',
  ]}
  projectCategories={['fireplace-new']}
  faqGroup="fireplaces"
/>
